OL,3,GNEWSASea Link cable project approved by
OL,4,Agovernment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major new undersea electricity cable
OL,7,Flinking Kent and Suffolk has been
OL,8,Fapproved by the government.
OL,10,FThe Sea Link project will help carry
OL,11,Felectricity generated by offshore wind
OL,12,Ffarms, interconnectors and nuclear
OL,13,Fpower stations to strengthen the grid.
OL,15,FThe 138km cable will run beneath the
OL,16,FNorth Sea between Pegwell Bay in Kent
OL,17,Fand the Suffolk coast near Aldeburgh
OL,18,Fand Thorpeness.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
